sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Source
    participant E as Sync Engine
    participant P as Parser
    participant I as Index

    S ->> E: Change detected (New/Mod/Del)
    E ->> S: Fetch content
    E ->> P: Send content
    P ->> P: Parse & Chunk
    P ->> I: Upsert (Embeddings + Metadata)
    E ->> I: Update/Delete entries